> Do somedy know something about a version of "hack" working on NeXT computers

     NetHack works fine on NeXT.  Just configure it for BSD Unix in config.h
and unixconf.h.  When you build from sources, you have to make sure that lex
and yacc get run instead of trying to use the prebuilt files included in the
distribution.  The easiest way is to put the file dates into a known state: 
 # first edit a few files according to the instructions; then
 % touch src/lev_comp.[ly]
 % make all install

